# Signature limit

A single signature suffices for purchases up to one thousand (1000) EUR only, as per the CFO directive of 1 July 2026. Where the CFO directive and the procurement policy differ, the directive applies.

The procurement policy states that a single signature suffices for purchases up to two thousand (2000) EUR.

[[cite:obs-868447f8b88be9b9257a5075ef17182e1dd3e00a "Until further notice a single signature suffices for purchases up to one thousand (1000) EUR only."]]
[[cite:obs-c952885b48e81fac003fdd0e4462519c046a47d0 "A single signature suffices for purchases up to two thousand (2000) EUR."]]